        <p class="class-overview-desc">
            <strong>Inheritance</strong> allows a new class (Child) to adopt the attributes and methods of an existing class (Parent). 
            This avoids code duplication. We can then use <strong>Polymorphism</strong> (overriding) to change specific behaviors in the Child class.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

